# The prebuilt V8 for the `v8` crate (Cargo.toml's [patch.crates-io]), read by
# fetch_rusty_v8.py (DENEXT.md item 162). One `<sha256>  <file>` line per
# release asset: the static library archive and the bindgen output for each of
# the six release targets. The lines are the release's own SHA256SUMS, checked
# again with `gh attestation verify <file> -R Brainwires/rusty_v8`; a V8 bump
# changes the tag and every line in the same commit as Cargo.toml's rev.
#
# PENDING: the hashes are added from SHA256SUMS once release v152.2.1-denext.1
# is published. Until then the fetch fails closed (no entry for the target).
# repo: Brainwires/rusty_v8
# tag: v152.2.1-denext.1
